Copyright: the FFmpeg developers
License: GPL-3.0-or-later
 CFA4's own build of FFmpeg 9.0.2 (ADR 0005), configured with --enable-gpl
 --enable-version3, never --enable-nonfree, without x264 and x265. Its licences
 and BUILDINFO (the unmodified upstream source and the configure flags) are in
 share/doc/ffmpeg beside the libraries. In the tarball, AppImage and Flatpak the
 third-party libraries it loads are bundled too; their copyright files are in
 lib/cfa4/ffmpeg-9.0.2/share/doc/third-party.

